WEBVTT

00:11:29.829 --> 00:11:31.262
where misdeeds and mistakes

00:11:31.262 --> 00:11:34.030
don't define you for the rest of your life.

00:11:34.030 --> 00:11:37.221
I think collectively, we can create that reality,

00:11:37.221 --> 00:11:38.924
and I hope you do too.

00:11:38.924 --> 00:11:40.690
Thank you.

00:11:40.690 --> 00:11:43.773
(Applause)